{
 "_report": "Apex Array on the V3 kit, built AROUND the untouched endgame core. Arrive by the glass lift on the Summit Lift terrace (146, kept: bay, shop stall, doors to the Observatory Halls 1F-4F 147-150 with the Quorum, and the Apex Library 152). The terrace road east no longer runs straight into the Great Telescope: it opens onto Observatory Junction (412), the first hub. North: Observatory Terrace (421) to the Icefall Cave (405 entrance, floors 406/407, Deep Chamber 409 with a chest). East: the Apex Relay Tower (427 -> trial floor 428 -> summit room 429 with a chest; no second keeper) and behind it the Secret Grove (422, chest). South: Summit Farmstead (432) to Tarn Fork (413), which leads east to the Summit Grand Stadium (401 -> lobby 403 -> arena 404), south to the Stargazer Overlook dead end (415, chest) and north past Meltwater Tarn (416, water edge) to Summit Crossroads (411). From 411: west Summit Lane Homes (430: kit Recovery Bay 426, Supply Shop 433, Linker Lounge 423) and the Apex Spaceport (434, ship home to Dustara); east Instrument Hollows (419) and Glacier Bend (420, icy water) to the Stargazer Quiet Court pocket (431: Telescope Room 424, Quorum Archive 425); north up the Summit Stairs (414) to the Great Telescope (151, Orra Venn and Dr. Vashti, unchanged), now the last climb. No loop: the world is a tree from 412 (412 -> 432 -> 413 -> 416 -> 411 is the spine). Shut house doors (no room left in the kit): 431 (6-7,4) and (20-21,12), both 432 houses.",
